      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "The product flow of nonwoven polyester textile includes the production and distribution of nonwoven fabrics made from polyester. The process encompasses the formation of fibers, bonding, entangling to create a fabric-like material, compliance with textile standards, quality control, and end-usage in various applications such as filtering, hygiene, or upholstery. It accounts for the entire route from production to distribution 'to consumer' or 'at plant', specifying the treatment process and quality specifics for the nonwoven polyester.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "非织造聚酯纺织品的产品流程包括聚酯非织布的生产和分销。该过程包括纤维的形成、粘合、缠结以创造类似织物的材料，符合纺织标准的要求、质量控制，以及在各种应用中的最终使用，如过滤、卫生或家具装饰。它涵盖了从生产到分销到消费者或在工厂的整个路线，明确了非织造聚酯的处理过程和质量细节。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
